ss=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\">\\(\\mathcal T\\)</span> 的核心真理机制)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> (五种标准理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SentDisq},\\mathsf{UniformDisq},\\mathsf{SKCompInd},\\mathsf{CompCapRel},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}\">\\(\\mathsf{SentDisq},\\mathsf{UniformDisq},\\mathsf{SKCompInd},\\mathsf{CompCapRel},\\mathsf{Supervaluation}\\)</span> (机制标签)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}overview}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Core}(\\mathrm{TB})=\\mathsf{SentDisq}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Core}(\\mathrm{UTB})=\\mathsf{UniformDisq}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Core}(\\mathrm{KF})=\\mathsf{SKCompInd}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{fact\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}overview}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Core}(\\mathrm{TB})=\\mathsf{SentDisq}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Core}(\\mathrm{UTB})=\\mathsf{UniformDisq}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Core}(\\mathrm{KF})=\\mathsf{SKCompInd}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\land\\\n\\operatorname{Core}(\\mathrm{FS})=\\mathsf{CompCapRel}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Core}(\\mathrm{VF})=\\mathsf{Supervaluation}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\land\\\n\\operatorname{Core}(\\mathrm{FS})=\\mathsf{CompCapRel}\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Core}(\\mathrm{VF})=\\mathsf{Supervaluation}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>理论</th>\n<th>核心机制</th>\n<th>对算术后果的标准结论</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>TB</td>\n<td>基础闭句去引号</td>\n<td>对 PA 保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTB</td>\n<td>基础公式的一致去引号</td>\n<td>对 PA 保守</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KF</td>\n<td>强 Kleene 组合公理与全真理语言归纳</td>\n<td>等强于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\varepsilon_0}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FS</td>\n<td>组合公理与 capture/release 规则</td>\n<td>等强于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathrm{RT}_{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VF</td>\n<td>超赋值公理</td>\n<td>等强于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ID}_1\">\\(\\mathrm{ID}_1\\)</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>由此不能得到按书写顺序递增的链。对标准版本的算术强度，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FS}&lt;\\mathrm{KF}&lt;\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{FS}&lt;\\mathrm{KF}&lt;\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span>；TB 与 UTB 则都落在 PA 的\n算术保守类中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-TB","status":"resolved","id":"6018cc1b13710826","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-TB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-UTB","status":"resolved","id":"2f215d3f10d33ae6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-UTB]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-FS","status":"resolved","id":"25c37fe51095276d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-FS]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-VF","status":"resolved","id":"669ee474b9646a38","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[